{"title":"7月1日起实施，住建部印发《城市轨道交通工程投资估算指标》","date":"2024-04-23","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">7</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施，住建部印发《城市轨道交通工程投资估算指标》</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:ZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">国务院有关部门：</span></p>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 15px 8px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; list-style: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:ZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">为合理确定和控制城市轨道交通工程投资，满足相关建设项目编制项目建议书和可行性研究报告投资估算的需要，我部组织修订了《城市轨道交通工程投资估算指标》（<span lang=\"EN-US\">ZYA3-12-2024</span>），自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施。原《城市轨道交通工程投资估算指标》（<span lang=\"EN-US\">GCG101-2008</span>）同时废止。</span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 15px 8px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; list-style: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:ZH-CN;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">本指标在住房城乡建设部门户网站（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.mohurd.gov.cn</span>）公开，并由住房城乡建设部标准定额研究所组织中国计划出版社有限公司出版发行。</span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 15px 8px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; list-style: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 15px 8px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; list-style: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\